# ============================================================
Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/
Drivers/CMSIS/Lib/
Drivers/CMSIS/NN/
Drivers/CMSIS/Core_A/
Drivers/CMSIS/RTOS/
Drivers/CMSIS/RTOS2/
Drivers/CMSIS/docs/

